# Storm Herald's enters trigger returns any number of Aura cards from YOUR graveyard attached to creatures YOU control (CR 303.4f,
# 303.4i): of Bot1's graveyard (Holy Strength, Eternal Warrior, Evil Presence) only the Auras that could enchant a creature Bot1
# controls are offered (Evil Presence enchants a land: not offered; the ruling), Bot2's Fear in Bot2's graveyard is not Bot1's, and
# Bot2's Dwarven Trader is not a host. Only the chosen Holy Strength returns (Herald 4/4); Eternal Warrior stays in the graveyard.
# Holy Strength is exiled at the beginning of Bot1's next end step, this turn's (CR 603.7).
# Bot1's Lion's Eye Diamond discards the hand on turn 1 (the Auras and a spare Mountain); Herald is drawn on turn 3 and paid with
# Mountain and Sol Ring. Bot2's turn 2 casts Dwarven Trader with a Mountain, then discards Fear with its own diamond.

